    "description": {
      "content": "The WHOOP API exposes member fitness, strain, recovery, sleep, workout, and body measurement data captured by the WHOOP wrist-worn wearable. OAuth 2.0 protected; v2 endpoints use UUID identifiers and webhook notifications keep integrations current.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: WHOOP Developer Support",
